# Document-Only Inputs

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-document-only-inputs.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-document-only-inputs.md)

## Locked: A

Documents = same pipeline as text. No separate document workflow. No “what should I know about this?” gate before interpreting.

Preserve → extract → LCR → what changed → ≤1–3 mapped asks if needed. Evidence maturity drives depth.

**First response = person's care reality**, never “I extracted N things from your PDF.”

Never expose OCR, confidence, parser, schema, or analyzer framing.
